        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-71, Large 2 Inch Acrylic Radiance Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 2 Inch Radiance Acrylic Cabinet Knob has a contemporary design that is both romantic and stylish. The Large 2 Inch Acrylic Radiance Cabinet Knob is available with satin nickel, polished nickel, and satin brass mounts. It has a transitional feel that makes it perfect for a wide array of interior home decors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-3-8-inch-radiance-acrylic-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-70\"><b>Small Radiance Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/radiance-clear-acrylic-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-470\"><b>Radiance Cabinet Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/12-inch-radiance-acrylic-appliance-pull-rk-international-ph-7000\"><b>12 Inch Radiance Appliance Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/18-inch-radiance-acrylic-appliance-pull-rk-international-ph-7001\"><b>18 Inch Radiance Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Radiance Cabinet Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Material: Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
